Patch for Isaac-GR00T at 65cc4a192e6d084650d97747308b6a8deb790722 (Apache-2.0), applied by
scripts/setup_groot.sh. Written by Zhekai Duan for the decent-vla GR00T runs.

It adds a PyAV backend to gr00t/utils/video_utils.py:get_frames_by_indices. The IPEC LIBERO videos are
AV1-encoded; torchcodec needs a system FFmpeg, which GH200 nodes do not have, while PyAV ships its own. It also
lets GROOT_FFMPEG_THREADS bound torchcodec's decoder threads (0, the default, keeps upstream behaviour).

